    "description": "Qin Yang, a young man with exceptional talents, possesses the coveted mystic artifact, the \"Star Gate\", which drew envy from others. Unfortunately, this treasure is taken away. As he approaches death, the dormant treasure within him, the \"Divine Pearl\", begins to awaken. At that moment, he regains memories from his past nine lives, and embarks on a new journey. Meanwhile, his family faces an unprecedented crisis. Enduring numerous trials, Qin Yang, with the experience and wisdom from his previous lives, takes charge and overcomes obstacle after obstacle. Unbeknownst to them, the conspirators continue their relentless pursuit. Nevertheless, Qin Yang, with his unwavering dedication to protecting his loved ones, chooses to fight on.",
